# Not written:
#   ipv4rule 5: what it allows cannot be said by a rule of Google Cloud
#   ipv4rule 7: what it allows cannot be said by a rule of Google Cloud
#   ipv4rule 11: not converted: source DYNAMIC: the address of the user who activates the rule set, or of the digital input
#   ipv4rule 12: not converted: service ENIP is not in the configuration; references 'ENIP': unsupported or undefined service
#   ipv4rule 13: the source of the rule is in zone ipsecALL, and a rule of Google Cloud names no zone: give the networks behind ipsecALL with --zone-network
#   ipv4rule 14: not converted: assigned to the rule set maintenance: it applies only while the set is activated (by a user or a digital input)
#   ipv4rule 15: what it allows cannot be said by a rule of Google Cloud
